    <description>NetPulse is a bare-bones Windows network diagnostic tool featuring continuous ping monitoring, traceroute, domain dossier (DNS, WHOIS, IP research), and root-cause analysis. Self-contained - no Python install required.</description>
    <summary>Bare-bones network diagnostic: ping, traceroute, domain dossier.</summary>
    <tags>network ping traceroute dns whois monitor diagnostic admin</tags>
